# Language-agnostic baseline, plus the C++ build tree below.

# Build (CMake)
build/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

# Editor / IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.#*
\#*\#

# Secrets / local env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Claude Code (local settings, history, allowlist — mostly personal).
# Drop the trailing slash so the negation below can re-include a
# specific file; with `.claude/` git short-circuits at the
# directory and ignores the !.claude/foo line.
.claude/*
# Team-shared Claude Code config that SHOULD be in version control:
!.claude/settings.json
# The release recipe cut-release reads (releases.md § 1).
!.claude/bump.json
# No `!.claude/workflow.md` here, deliberately. `workflow.md` § 1 forbids a
# per-project workflow, and reserving the path reads as a prescription to
# create one. That file is also `/app-workflow`'s trigger, so creating it
# routes drift work to the predecessor `workflow.md` replaced.

# Logs / runtime
*.log
*.pid
*.sock

# Coverage / sanitizers
*.gcda
*.gcno
*.gcov
coverage.*
.coverage
lcov.info

# Core dumps
core
core.*
*.core
vgcore.*
# ...but not the source directory of the same name.
!src/core/

# Scratch
scratch/
tmp/
Screenshot_*.png
screenshot*.png

# Roadmap ID counter — derived per-machine cache, not source.
# True high-water mark is the highest ID across ROADMAP.md +
# CHANGELOG.md + docs/roadmap/*.md (roadmap-format.md § 3.5.1).
.roadmap-counter
